==Overview==
[[Boss Toilet 3.0]] is a stronger version of [[Boss Toilet 2.0]]. It can stun towers with its lasers. It appears as the final boss of [[Hard Mode]] and one of the mid and late game bosses of [[Nightmare Mode]]. It is slower than [[Boss Toilet 2.0]], but has much more health.  
