==Strategy==
*Boss Toilet 3.0 has a lot of health, so you should use high DPS units. Units like [[Jetpack Cameraman|Jetpack Cameraman,]] [[Titan Cameraman|Titan Cameraman,]] or any [[Mythic]]  [[Godly]] [[Ultimate]] and some [[Legendary]]<nowiki/>s will probably work.

